id: flash-text
section: Flash
item: Text typed on the system keyboard lands exact in a movie's input field: mixed case, digits, space and Backspace, by the movie's own report of its field
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=text
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 85
expect keyboard down
pause 800
dtap 240 207
expect keyboard up
pause 1500
type-keys Hello
wait text text "text Hello" 6
type-keys " World 123"
wait text text "text Hello World 123" 8
type-keys "<<<x9"
wait text text "text Hello World x9" 8
expect card-scroll 0 5
tap-at 600 500
expect keyboard down
